dashboard.definition:
{
	"title": "FOCUS Domains",
	"description": "The Domains of the FinOps Framework describe the fundamental business outcomes organizations should achieve from the FinOps practice. In other words, practicing FinOps will allow organizations to understand their cloud usage and cost, quantify its business value, optimize both usage and rates paid, and manage an effective practice.",
